# Resource folders read at runtime via make_my_figure_core.resources.resource_path.
# They live at the project root in a checkout; setup.py stages them into the package at
# build time so an installed wheel can find them. Listing them here puts them in the sdist,
# so a build from the sdist can stage them too.
graft schemas
graft style_profiles
graft mock_data
graft examples

include LICENSE
include README.md
include pyproject.toml

recursive-exclude * __pycache__
recursive-exclude * *.py[co]
